  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Veterans Evaluation Services obligated $1.7B in FY26 to date. Veterans Evaluation Services received 25 awards this fiscal year to date, with an average award size of $66.3M. Obligations fell 18.5% year over year. The company’s fiscal-year obligations show growth through FY25 followed by a partial-year pullback in FY26: FY21 totaled $617M, FY22 totaled $691M, FY23 totaled $693M, FY24 totaled $1.1B, and FY25 totaled $2B. The current-year totals are partial and reflect obligations rather than total contract values. The available figures are contract obligations except where award-value captions specify total contract values. Readers should treat FY26 as a fiscal-year-to-date number rather than a full-year total. These figures show scale, award count, and average award size but do not include a breakdown by buying agency, product category, or lists of specific expiring contracts.",
