      {
        "heading": "How have obligations trended over the last five fiscal years?",
        "body": "Veterans Evaluation Services obligations rose from $617M in FY21 to $691M in FY22 and $693M in FY23, then increased to $1.1B in FY24 and $2B in FY25. Veterans Evaluation Services obligations in FY26 are $1.7B to date, a partial-year figure that follows the FY25 peak."
